{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object found, move to it, grab it and process it, then do task. Otherwise, scan area for object. list of available nodes: <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = FindObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectGrabbable    /> <Action ID = DoTask    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    />",
